<title>USA: Signature Inns IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Signature Inns IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead underwriter McDonald &amp; Co Securities Inc said the planned initial public offering of Signature Inns Inc was postponed indefinitely.</p>
<p>The Indianapolis, Indiana hotel company had filed to offer 3.3 million shares, to price in an estimated range of $11-$13 each and trade on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;SGNS&quot;.</p>
</text>
